@startuml
skin rose
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 360
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9B0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A80036
skinparam NoteFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackGroundColor transparent
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #F2F2F2
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #F7F7F7
skinparam LegendFontSize 12
title <size:18>Release of pull request 482, passing</size>
box "ARTIE and the replies it makes" #EEEEEE
actor ARTIE as ARTIE
participant "ARTIE's replies\n:8160" as P8160
end box
participant "GitHub\n(gateway :8098)" as P8098
participant "Offer watch\n:8099" as P8099
box "CI" #F4F4FA
participant "CI wrapper\n:8170" as P8170
participant "Jenkins\n:8171" as P8171
end box
participant "Preview\n:8180" as P8180
participant "Dev\n:8190" as P8190
== Open the pull request ==
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8098 : <b>1</b> GET /\n<i>ARTIE reads GitHub's entry, through the gateway</i>
P8098 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8098 : <b>2</b> GET /repos/acme/web/pulls/482\n<i>ARTIE opens pull request {pull} as pr</i>
P8098 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>open</b>
== Watch ==
ARTIE -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>3</b> POST /_release/replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<i>ARTIE makes its reply {reply}, before asking</i>
P8160 -[#1B7F3B]-> ARTIE : 204 No Content
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8099 : <b>4</b> GET /\n<i>ARTIE reads the offer watch's entry</i>
P8099 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8099 : <b>5</b> POST /actions/watch\n<i>with </i><b>hr:reply-to</b><i>, </i><b>hr:keys</b>\n<i>ARTIE asks to be told when {pr} offers {offers}, on reply {reply} as watch</i>
P8099 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 201 Created
note right of P8099
<b>Location</b> = /watches/1
end note
loop #E9F5EC until the reply is answered
P8099 -[#1F4FB8]> P8098 : <b>·</b> GET /repos/acme/web/pulls/482\nlooks every 3 s, until it offers github:merge
ARTIE -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>6</b> GET /replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<i>Once {watch} says it can be merged: ARTIE's reply {reply} is awaiting</i>
P8160 -[#1B7F3B]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>awaiting</b>
P8099 -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>·</b> PATCH /replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<b>hr:progress</b>, signed by its key\n"Still looking: github:merge is not offered yet"
ARTIE -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>7</b> GET /replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<i>Once {watch} says it can be merged: ARTIE's reply {reply} is awaiting</i>
P8160 -[#1B7F3B]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>awaiting</b>
P8099 -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>·</b> PATCH /replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<b>hr:completed</b>, signed by its key
ARTIE -[#1B7F3B]> P8160 : <b>8</b> GET /replies/r-pr-482-1794459598\n<i>Once {watch} says it can be merged: ARTIE's reply {reply} is completed</i>
P8160 -[#1B7F3B]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>completed</b>
note right of P8160
<b>_links.about</b> = /repos/acme/web/pulls/482
<b>_links.hr:in-reply-to</b> = /watches/1
end note
end
== Merge ==
