P8098 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>open</b>
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8098 : <b>10</b> PUT /repos/acme/web/pulls/482/actions/merge\n<i>ARTIE merges it by squashing as merged</i>
P8098 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>closed</b>
ARTIE -[#A80036]> P8098 : <b>11</b> GET /repos/acme/web/pulls/482\n<i>ARTIE reads {pr} as merged, for its merge commit</i>
P8098 -[#A80036]-> ARTIE : 200 OK <b>closed</b>
